nabling business users to map colour attribute values (Floral, Cream, etc.) to a hex code or swatch image | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Assign one primary colour - probably have an attribute to capture multi colours | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-26> |\n| SPR-27 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support an Availability filter, which supports at minimum the following product states: \"In Stock\" | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-27> |\n| SPR-28 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must display applied filter state as visible labels within the filter panel for multi-choice facets (e.g., Colour, Material, Size), with the ability to remove filters individually or clear all at once | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-28> |\n| SPR-29 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support sort options on the PLP (e.g. Best Sellers, Price, Newest Arrival); the sort options available to shoppers and the default sort order per category will be configurable by a business user in Business Manager | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-29> |\n| SPR-30 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support multivariate testing of sorting rules on category pages natively in Business Manager | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-30> |\n| SPR-31 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must automatically demote or suppress out-of-stock products within category and search results, without requiring manual intervention by the merchandising team | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Additional Note: option to turn this on in certain categories is needed, on some pages manual preferred (can be configured in BM) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-31> |\n| SPR-32 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support explicit product ordering based on a manually assigned rank, configurable by a business user in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-32> |\n| SPR-33 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | ~~Search~~ | ~~How will colour and material grouping be structured in SFCC to support products that span multiple colour groups, and how will swatches be displayed where multiple groups apply? Colour mapping exercise TBC~~ | ~~Accenture~~ | ~~ALL~~ |  |  |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-33> |\n| SPR-34 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support real-time keyword search across all product attributes (e.g. name, description, colour, size, material), returning ranked results | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-34> |\n| SPR-35 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will be able to submit a search and navigate to the results page when the user presses Enter or taps the Search button | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-35> |\n| SPR-36 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display ~~\"Search Items\" as the~~ placeholder text in the search input | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-36> |\n| SPR-37 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must provide predictive autocomplete suggestions as customers type, surfacing relevant products, categories, and trending search terms | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-37> |\n| SPR-38 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a focused state when the search input is focused with no text, showing: Popular Searches (configured trending terms), category navigation shortcuts, and a product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-38> |\n| SPR-39 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must render the typed autocomplete as a two-panel layout: left panel showing keyword suggestion; right panel showing product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-39> |\n| SPR-40 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must include a \"View All\" link within the autocomplete panel, directing to the full search results page | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-40> |\n| SPR-41 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must surface category shortcut links within the autocomplete dropdown, allowing direct navigation to a category page without completing a full search | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-41> |\n| SPR-42 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must support Popular Search terms that can be both manually curated by business users and algorithmically driven with Einstein | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-42> |\n| SPR-43 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display local currency pricing in search autocomplete results, driven by currency conversion feeds; Global-e handles product prices for all international storefronts | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-43> |\n| SPR-44 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will apply search dictionary rules to the results query, ensuring that synonyms, related terms, and AI-recommended dictionary entries are reflected in the returned result set. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-44> |\n| SPR-45 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display the total result count on the search results page in the format '[X] RESULTS'. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-45> |\n| SPR-46 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will render a breadcrumb on the search results page as: HOME > SEARCH RESULTS FOR '[QUERY]'. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-46> |\n| SPR-47 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display the search term the user entered on the zero-results page, so they can confirm what was searched. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-47> |\n| SPR-48 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a search input field on the zero-results page so the user can run a new search without navigating away from the page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-48> |\n| SPR-49 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a result count of zero on the zero-results page, clearly communicating that no matches were found. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-49> |\n| SPR-50 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a curated product or content module on the zero-results page (e.g. New Arrivals) to provide alternative discovery pathways when no results are found. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-50> |\n| SPR-51 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a message on the zero-results page encouraging the user to modify or broaden their search query. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-51> |\n| SPR-52 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a set of navigational shortcuts on the zero-results page to key site destinations (e.g. Shipping, Returns, Privacy) to help users continue their journey. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-52> |\n| SPR-53 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display an alternative search term on the zero-results page that the user can select to rerun the search, where a likely spelling variant exists. | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-53> |\n| SPR-54 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support merchandiser-configured search redirects, automatically navigating customers to a designated page when a matching redirect rule is triggered in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-54> |\n| SPR-55 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display products in a grid layout on the search results page, with the number of columns adapting responsively across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-55> |\n| SPR-56 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display each product tile on the search results page with product image, product name, and price. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-56> |\n| SPR-57 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support ordering and multi-facet filtering of search results; available facets and sort options will be driven by indexed product attributes and configured by a business user via the Search Refinement Definitions in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-57> |\n| SPR-58 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must display a \"You May Also Like\" or equivalent recommendations carousel on the PDP, Cart, slide-out Mini-Bag, and My Account page, powered by SFCC Einstein Product Recommendations | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-58> |\n| SPR-59 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support a mix of AI-driven and rules-gated recommendation logic, with the ability to configure rules by season and category | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-59> |\n| SPR-60 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support a \"Complete the Look\" cross-sell surface on the PDP, Cart, and slide-out Mini-Bag, configurable through Salesforce Commerce Cloud | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-60> |\n| SPR-61 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must display \"Recently Viewed\" products on the PDP and Cart page; browsing history to be stored in the browser session and persisted cross-session on login | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-61> |\n| SPR-62 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must allow Add to Bag via size variant selection directly from recommendation carousels on the PDP and Cart pages | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | @Tim Lavelle @Marcel Angelo Navarro - open discussion on whether user should go to product page, and whether this can be toggled on/off (this would require customisation, and be an enhancement) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-62> |\n| SPR-63 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support AI-driven merchandising using SFCC Einstein, enabling automated product ordering on category pages and search result pages based on behavioural data and performance signals | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Additional note: Functionality to be used on sub category pages, not major pages like New Arrivals etc - not sure if feasible @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) @Victor T. Crisostomo to check | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-63> |\n| SPR-64 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must support the display of an editorial hero image, including an optional headline and body text, inline within the product grid on category pages, configurable by a business user in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-64> |\n| SPR-65 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must display a configurable set of inline category links on the product listing page, positioned below the hero image and above the product grid. The links must be contextual, reflecting the subcategories relevant to the current page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-65> |\n| SPR-66 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must allow business users to define and prioritise which subcategories appear inline per page in Business Manager, with the full category set remaining accessible within the filtering panel alongside standard filters. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-66> |\n| SPR-67 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | ~~The system must allow business users to insert editorial or video content into PLPs and/or feature certain products on larger tiles within the grid (manually merchandised features).~~ | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed | Descoped as requirement written by Zimmermann, will be design dependent | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-67> |\n| SPR-68 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must allow business users to create new filters and manually assign products to them when needed (overriding their default data). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-68> |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
